                                            <Run Text="• 标注结果根目录：复用「切片导出目录」字段；批处理结果落于此下。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 像素精度：一个像素的物理尺寸（μm/px），供后续尺寸测量；1 mm = 1000 μm。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 模型路径：ONNX 绝对路径；空则用默认 Dlls\Models\CTOffline\model_500000_900.onnx。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• CUDA：ModelInit 的 IsRunCuda，默认开启。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 打黑高度：界面自控（OfflineCtBlackHeight），增强图用全高；原图默认减半。底部四栏：L1~L5范围 / 电芯1 / 电芯2 / 手动预留；开启范围判断后汇总数值合格绿/超差红，未启用白；二次手动标注共用右栏；传给 NJCT 的 BlackHeight 固定 0。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 结果图模式：增强图 / 原图 / 两者（默认增强图）。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 竖图校验：宽&gt;高则 CW90°；已竖不转。送检图用临时文件，推理后删除，不写 input/。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 内容上移：OfflineCtContentShiftUpPx（px）。主体向上平移，画布不变、底部黑填，适配 DLL 偏上裁切；0=不上移。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 预提亮：调用算法前计算 ROI 均值/P50，偏暗则分区提亮（方案B，默认开）。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 产品目录默认只保留成功结果图；失败不落盘。JSON/CSV 默认关，可在「预处理与输出」勾选。" />
                                            <LineBreak />
                                            <Run Text="• 导出 JSON/CSV：可选，默认不导出。" />
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </ToolTip>
                                </Border.ToolTip>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                            </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- 交接目录与结果根 -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="输入与输出目录" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="「开始流程」扫描交接目录根下一层图像（{产品名}.jpg），结果写入标注结果根目录下各子文件夹。" />
                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="上视图交接目录" />
                                        <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" hc:InfoElement.Necessary="True">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="TopViewHandoffFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <Button Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}" Width="40" MinWidth="40" Padding="0"
                                                Command="{Binding OpenTopViewHandoffFolderCommand}" ToolTip="选择上视图交接目录">
                                            <Image Width="18">
                                                <Image.Source>
                                                    <DrawingImage>
                                                        <DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                            <DrawingGroup>
                                                                <GeometryDrawing Brush="Black" Geometry="M245,110.64A16,16,0,0,0,232,104H216V88a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H130.67L102.94,51.2a16.14,16.14,0,0,0-9.6-3.2H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,64V208h0a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H211.1a8,8,0,0,0,7.59-5.47l28.49-85.47A16.05,16.05,0,0,0,245,110.64ZM93.34,64,123.2,86.4A8,8,0,0,0,128,88h72v16H69.77a16,16,0,0,0-15.18,10.94L40,158.7V64Zm112,136H43.1l26.67-80H232Z" />
                                                            </DrawingGroup>
                                                        </DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                    </DrawingImage>
                                                </Image.Source>
                                            </Image>
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="{Binding SliceExportFolderLabel}" />
                                        <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" hc:InfoElement.Necessary="True"
                                                    ToolTip="批处理输出根：{本目录}/{产品名}/">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="SliceExportFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <Button Grid.Column="2" Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}" Width="40" MinWidth="40" Padding="0"
                                                Command="{Binding OpenSliceExportFolderCommand}" ToolTip="选择标注结果根目录">
                                            <Image Width="18">
                                                <Image.Source>
                                                    <DrawingImage>
                                                        <DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                            <DrawingGroup>
                                                                <GeometryDrawing Brush="Black" Geometry="M245,110.64A16,16,0,0,0,232,104H216V88a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H130.67L102.94,51.2a16.14,16.14,0,0,0-9.6-3.2H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,64V208h0a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H211.1a8,8,0,0,0,7.59-5.47l28.49-85.47A16.05,16.05,0,0,0,245,110.64ZM93.34,64,123.2,86.4A8,8,0,0,0,128,88h72v16H69.77a16,16,0,0,0-15.18,10.94L40,158.7V64Zm112,136H43.1l26.67-80H232Z" />
                                                            </DrawingGroup>
                                                        </DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                    </DrawingImage>
                                                </Image.Source>
                                            </Image>
                                        </Button>
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- 像素精度等标定 -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="尺寸标定" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="配置像素物理尺寸供后续测量换算。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="像素精度"
                                            ToolTip="一个像素的物理尺寸，单位微米（μm/px）" />
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1">
                                            <DockPanel LastChildFill="False">
                                                <hc:TextBox
                                                    Width="160"
                                                    DockPanel.Dock="Left"
                                                    ToolTip="单位：μm/px（微米/像素），可填小数，如 1.65 或 0.5">
                                                    <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                        <Binding
                                                            Path="OfflineCtPixelSizeUmText"
                                                            UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged"
                                                            Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                    </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                </hc:TextBox>
                                                <TextBlock
                                                    Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                    Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}"
                                                    Text="μm/px" />
                                            </DockPanel>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                Text="供后续尺寸测量：物理长度 = 像素数 × 像素精度" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource CasInfoCalloutStyle}">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}"
                                                Margin="0,0,0,6"
                                                Text="尺寸换算（毫米 ↔ 微米）" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="1 mm = 1000 μm" />
                                            <TextBlock Margin="0,4,0,0" Text="{Binding OfflineCtPixelSizeFormulaUm}" />
                                            <TextBlock Margin="0,2,0,0" Text="{Binding OfflineCtPixelSizeFormulaMm}" />
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                Text="数学单位：像素精度 s [μm·px⁻¹]；N_px 为像素数；L 为物理长度。" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- 模型与推理 -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="模型与推理" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="ONNX 模型路径、CUDA；打黑高度=增强图底部覆盖高度（原图自动减半）；结果图模式决定落盘增强图 / 原图。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="模型路径"
                                            ToolTip="空则使用默认部署路径 Dlls\Models\CTOffline\model_500000_900.onnx" />
                                        <hc:TextBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            ToolTip="空则使用默认部署路径 Dlls\Models\CTOffline\model_500000_900.onnx">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="OfflineCtModelPath" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Command="{Binding BrowseOfflineCtModelPathCommand}"
                                                Content="浏览" />
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Command="{Binding ResetOfflineCtModelPathCommand}"
                                                Content="默认"
                                                ToolTip="清空为默认模型路径" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="CUDA" />
                                        <CheckBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Content="启用 GPU CUDA"
                                            IsChecked="{Binding OfflineCtIsRunCuda}" />
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="2"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="打黑高度"
                                            ToolTip="增强图底部覆盖打黑高度（写入 L1~L5）；原图自动减半；二次手动标注共用增强图高度；不传给 NJCT" />
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="3" Orientation="Vertical" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                            <hc:TextBox
                                                Width="160"
                                                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                ToolTip="增强图底部覆盖打黑高度（写入 L1~L5）；原图自动减半；二次手动标注共用增强图高度；不传给 NJCT">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtBlackHeight" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                                        <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                            <hc:RegexRule Type="PInt" />
                                                        </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                    </Binding>
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                Text="{Binding OfflineCtOriginBlackHeightHint}"
                                                TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                MaxWidth="360" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}" Margin="0">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="结果图模式" />
                                        <ComboBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            Width="220"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                            ItemsSource="{Binding OfflineCtResultImageModeOptions}"
                                            SelectedItem="{Binding OfflineCtResultImageModeDisplay, Mode=TwoWay}" />
                                    </Grid>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- L1~L5 范围判断 -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="L1~L5 范围判断" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="开启后按 mm 校验尺寸：合格线段/数值为绿色，超差为红色；名称保持原色。底部遮罩仅显示 mm。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="范围判断" />
                                        <CheckBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormCheckItemStyle}"
                                            Content="开启范围判断"
                                            IsChecked="{Binding EnableOfflineCtLRangeCheck}"
                                            ToolTip="勾选后显示 L1~L5 左右限，并在打黑区第一栏写出范围；出图时 AI 汇总数值：合格绿 / 超差红 / 未开白" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <StackPanel
                                        Visibility="{Binding EnableOfflineCtLRangeCheck, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                            Margin="0,0,0,6"
                                            Text="单位：mm（可填小数，如 0.35）；左=下限，右=上限（可对调，内部按较小/较大值判断）。" />

                                        <!-- L1 -->
                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="L1" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" Width="100" ToolTip="L1 下限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL1MinMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Margin="8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="~" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="3" Width="100" ToolTip="L1 上限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL1MaxMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" Text="mm" />
                                        </Grid>

                                        <!-- L2 -->
                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="L2" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" Width="100" ToolTip="L2 下限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL2MinMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Margin="8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="~" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="3" Width="100" ToolTip="L2 上限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL2MaxMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" Text="mm" />
                                        </Grid>

                                        <!-- L3 -->
                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="L3" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" Width="100" ToolTip="L3 下限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL3MinMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Margin="8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="~" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="3" Width="100" ToolTip="L3 上限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL3MaxMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" Text="mm" />
                                        </Grid>

                                        <!-- L4 -->
                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="L4" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" Width="100" ToolTip="L4 下限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL4MinMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Margin="8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="~" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="3" Width="100" ToolTip="L4 上限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL4MaxMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" Text="mm" />
                                        </Grid>

                                        <!-- L5 -->
                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}" Margin="0">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="L5" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" Width="100" ToolTip="L5 下限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL5MinMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Margin="8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Text="~" />
                                            <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="3" Width="100" ToolTip="L5 上限 mm（可小数）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtL5MaxMmText" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" Mode="TwoWay" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" Text="mm" />
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- 预处理与输出（默认折叠） -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <Expander
                                    Header="预处理与输出"
                                    IsExpanded="False"
                                    Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}">
                                    <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                            Text="推理前保证竖图（临时送检，不落盘 input/）；主体偏下时可上移内容、底部黑填。产品目录默认只留成功结果图。" />

                                        <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,8">
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Grid.Column="0"
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                                Text="内容上移" />
                                            <hc:TextBox
                                                Grid.Column="1"
                                                ToolTip="喂给视觉前：内容向上平移的像素数。画布高宽不变，底部用黑边填充，便于 DLL 裁掉无效底边。0=不上移。">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtContentShiftUpPx" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Grid.Column="2"
                                                Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                                VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}"
                                                Text="px（底部黑填）" />
                                        </Grid>

                                        <UniformGrid Columns="2" Margin="0,0,0,4">
                                            <CheckBox
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormCheckItemStyle}"
                                                Content="调用前条件提亮"
                                                IsChecked="{Binding EnableOfflineCtPreBrighten}"
                                                ToolTip="方案B：按暗部/中间调/高光/白场分区提亮（类PS），偏暗才处理；保护高光防过曝" />
                                            <CheckBox
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormCheckItemStyle}"
                                                Content="输出 annotation.json（可选）"
                                                IsChecked="{Binding OfflineCtExportJson}"
                                                ToolTip="默认关闭；勾选才额外写 JSON" />
                                            <CheckBox
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormCheckItemStyle}"
                                                Content="输出 annotation.csv（可选）"
                                                IsChecked="{Binding OfflineCtExportCsv}"
                                                ToolTip="默认关闭；勾选才额外写 CSV" />
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                Text="默认只落盘成功结果图"
                                                ToolTip="预处理用临时文件；失败不写图；JSON/CSV 需手动勾选" />
                                        </UniformGrid>

                                        <Expander
                                            Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                            Header="预提亮高级参数"
                                            IsExpanded="False"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}">
                                            <StackPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                                                <TextBlock
                                                    Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                    Margin="0,0,0,10"
                                                    Text="ROI 亮度低于触发值时提亮；目标均值过高易过曝。" />
                                                <Grid>
                                                    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="12" />
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="12" />
                                                        <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                                    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                    <hc:TextBox
                                                        Grid.Column="0"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.Title="均值触发"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Top"
                                                        ToolTip="ROI 均值低于此值则提亮（默认120）">
                                                        <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                            <Binding Path="OfflineCtPreBrightenMeanTrigger" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                                        </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    </hc:TextBox>
                                                    <hc:TextBox
                                                        Grid.Column="2"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.Title="P50 触发"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Top"
                                                        ToolTip="ROI P50 低于此值则提亮（默认110）">
                                                        <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                            <Binding Path="OfflineCtPreBrightenP50Trigger" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                                        </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    </hc:TextBox>
                                                    <hc:TextBox
                                                        Grid.Column="4"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.Title="目标均值"
                                                        hc:InfoElement.TitlePlacement="Top"
                                                        ToolTip="提亮目标 ROI 均值（默认132；过高易过曝）">
                                                        <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                            <Binding Path="OfflineCtPreBrightenTargetMean" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                                        </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    </hc:TextBox>
                                                </Grid>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                        </Expander>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Expander>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- NJCT DLL 直调批量测试（不走主流程） -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="NJCT DLL 直调批量测试" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="仅测试 DLL：批量读入文件夹图片 → 直接调用 ModelAction / ModelAction_origin。下方「DLL打黑高度」为增强图传给 NJCT 的 BlackHeight；原图自动减半。不做竖图/提亮/内容上移，也不做上位机底部叠加。结果图模式沿用上方「模型与推理」。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="输入文件夹"
                                            ToolTip="递归扫描 jpg/png/bmp/tif" />
                                        <hc:TextBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            ToolTip="递归扫描 jpg/png/bmp/tif">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="OfflineCtDllTestInputFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <Button
                                            Grid.Column="2"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                            Command="{Binding BrowseOfflineCtDllTestInputFolderCommand}"
                                            Content="浏览"
                                            IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="输出文件夹"
                                            ToolTip="DLL 返回 ResultImg 直接落盘到此目录" />
                                        <hc:TextBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            ToolTip="DLL 返回 ResultImg 直接落盘到此目录">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="OfflineCtDllTestOutputFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <Button
                                            Grid.Column="2"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                            Command="{Binding BrowseOfflineCtDllTestOutputFolderCommand}"
                                            Content="浏览"
                                            IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="DLL打黑高度"
                                            ToolTip="增强图传给 NJCT 的 BlackHeight；原图自动减半（与主流程打黑高度规则一致）" />
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Vertical" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                            <hc:TextBox
                                                Width="160"
                                                HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                ToolTip="增强图传给 NJCT 的 BlackHeight；原图自动减半（与主流程打黑高度规则一致）">
                                                <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                    <Binding Path="OfflineCtDllTestBlackHeight" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged">
                                                        <Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                            <hc:RegexRule Type="Int" />
                                                        </Binding.ValidationRules>
                                                    </Binding>
                                                </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                            </hc:TextBox>
                                            <TextBlock
                                                Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                                Text="{Binding OfflineCtDllTestOriginBlackHeightHint}"
                                                TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                MaxWidth="420" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Button
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasPrimaryButtonStyle}"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                        MinWidth="200"
                                        Margin="152,4,0,0"
                                        Command="{Binding RunOfflineCtDllBatchTestCommand}"
                                        Content="批量直调 DLL"
                                        IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                        ToolTip="批量调用 NJCT.dll；BlackHeight=本区「DLL打黑高度」；不接入主程序预处理与叠加" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- 独立标注 -->
                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}" Margin="0">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="独立标注" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="对单张图片执行标注。输出文件夹可留空，默认输出到输入图片所在目录。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="输入图片" />
                                        <hc:TextBox Grid.Column="1" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="OfflineCtManualInputImagePath" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <Button
                                            Grid.Column="2"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                            Command="{Binding BrowseOfflineCtManualInputImageCommand}"
                                            Content="浏览"
                                            IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="输出文件夹"
                                            ToolTip="留空则输出到输入图片所在目录" />
                                        <hc:TextBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            ToolTip="留空则输出到输入图片所在目录">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="OfflineCtManualOutputFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Command="{Binding BrowseOfflineCtManualOutputFolderCommand}"
                                                Content="浏览"
                                                IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}" />
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Command="{Binding ClearOfflineCtManualOutputFolderCommand}"
                                                Content="清空"
                                                IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                                ToolTip="清空输出文件夹，恢复默认（输入图目录）" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Button
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasPrimaryButtonStyle}"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                        MinWidth="180"
                                        Margin="152,4,0,0"
                                        Command="{Binding RunOfflineCtManualAnnotationCommand}"
                                        Content="开始标注"
                                        IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                        ToolTip="使用上方模型/CUDA/打黑高度/结果图模式等参数，对指定输入图执行 AI 标注" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>
                </Border>

                <!-- 二次手动标注 -->
                <Border Visibility="{Binding IsNavManualMeasure, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}" Style="{StaticResource CasWhiteCardStyle}">
                    <Grid>
                        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                            <RowDefinition Height="*" MinHeight="220" />
                        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                <TextBlock Text="二次手动标注（测距）" Style="{StaticResource CasSectionHeaderStyle}" Margin="0"/>
                                <Border Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpIconBorderStyle}">
                                    <Border.ToolTip>
                                        <ToolTip>
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpToolTipTextStyle}">
                                                <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="本组作用" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run Text="AI 标注完成后，对漏检部位进行人工两点测距补标。" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="操作" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run Text="打开文件夹 → 全屏工作台；左键定起点/终点；Shift 正交约束；默认导出到该文件夹下 result/（可在标注界面改选）。" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="距离" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run Text="N_px = hypot(Δx,Δy)；L_μm = N_px × 像素精度；L_mm = L_μm / 1000。" />
                                            </TextBlock>
                                        </ToolTip>
                                    </Border.ToolTip>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                                </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="开始标注" />
                                    <TextBlock
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionDescStyle}"
                                        Text="递归读取所选文件夹及子文件夹中的图片；已导出的 result（及历史 output）内标注可自动续标。" />

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}" Text="像素精度" />
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}"
                                            Text="{Binding OfflineCtPixelSizeUm, StringFormat={}{0:G} μm/px（来自 AI 图像标注 · 尺寸标定）}" />
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Grid Style="{StaticResource CasFormRowStyle}">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="140" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Grid.Column="0"
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormLabelStyle}"
                                            Text="{Binding SliceExportFolderLabel}"
                                            ToolTip="与「AI图像标注」中的标注结果根目录同步；有路径则下方按钮直开，清空后弹窗自选" />
                                        <hc:TextBox
                                            Grid.Column="1"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            ToolTip="与 AI 图像标注页「标注结果根目录」为同一配置">
                                            <hc:TextBox.Text>
                                                <Binding Path="SliceExportFolder" UpdateSourceTrigger="PropertyChanged" />
                                            </hc:TextBox.Text>
                                        </hc:TextBox>
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Width="40"
                                                MinWidth="40"
                                                Padding="0"
                                                Command="{Binding OpenSliceExportFolderCommand}"
                                                ToolTip="选择标注结果根目录">
                                                <Image Width="18">
                                                    <Image.Source>
                                                        <DrawingImage>
                                                            <DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                                <DrawingGroup>
                                                                    <GeometryDrawing Brush="Black" Geometry="M245,110.64A16,16,0,0,0,232,104H216V88a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H130.67L102.94,51.2a16.14,16.14,0,0,0-9.6-3.2H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,64V208h0a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H211.1a8,8,0,0,0,7.59-5.47l28.49-85.47A16.05,16.05,0,0,0,245,110.64ZM93.34,64,123.2,86.4A8,8,0,0,0,128,88h72v16H69.77a16,16,0,0,0-15.18,10.94L40,158.7V64Zm112,136H43.1l26.67-80H232Z" />
                                                                </DrawingGroup>
                                                            </DrawingImage.Drawing>
                                                        </DrawingImage>
                                                    </Image.Source>
                                                </Image>
                                            </Button>
                                            <Button
                                                Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                                Command="{Binding ClearSliceExportFolderCommand}"
                                                Content="清空"
                                                ToolTip="清空标注结果根目录；下次打开将弹窗自选" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <Border Style="{StaticResource CasInfoCalloutStyle}" Margin="0,8,0,12">
                                        <StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,0,0,4" Text="测距快捷操作" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="• 标注模式 (A) / 移动模式 (H)　• 空格或中键拖拽：平移" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="• 定 P1 后右键或 Esc：取消起点　• 滚轮缩放　• Ctrl+Z：撤回　• ↑↓：切换图片" />
            <TextBlock Text="• 拖拽标签避挡 / 双击改名；底部右 1/4 遮罩汇总手动 mm（左 3/4 为 AI 范围与电芯）" />
                                            <TextBlock Text="• 导出：默认写入 {打开文件夹}/result/（index.json + 单图 json + 叠加图）；标注界面可改选目录" />
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Border>

                                    <Button
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasPrimaryButtonStyle}"
                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                        MinWidth="220"
                                        Command="{Binding OpenManualMeasureFolderCommand}"
                                        Content="打开文件夹开始标注"
                                        IsEnabled="{Binding IsEnableSimulationBtn}"
                                        ToolTip="使用上方标注结果根目录；有路径直开，无路径弹窗自选并写回" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- 最新 AI 标注结果预览 -->
                        <Border
                            Grid.Row="1"
                            Margin="0,14,0,0"
                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}"
                            Padding="12">
                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                                </Grid.RowDefinitions>
                                <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,8" LastChildFill="True">
                                    <Button
                                        DockPanel.Dock="Right"
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                        Content="刷新预览"
                                        Command="{Binding RefreshLatestAiAnnotationPreviewCommand}"
                                        ToolTip="重新扫描标注结果根目录，显示最新 AI 结果图" />
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionTitleStyle}" Text="最新 AI 标注预览" Margin="0" />
                                        <TextBlock
                                            Style="{StaticResource CasFormHintStyle}"
                                            Text="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreviewInfo}"
                                            TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"
                                            ToolTip="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreviewPath}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </DockPanel>
                                <Border
                                    Grid.Row="1"
                                    Background="#FF1A1A1A"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource CasBorderBrush}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="6"
                                    ClipToBounds="True"
                                    MinHeight="200">
                                    <Grid>
                                        <TextBlock
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}"
                                            Text="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreviewInfo}"
                                            TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                            Margin="16"
                                            TextAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock.Style>
                                                <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                    <Style.Triggers>
                                                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasLatestAiAnnotationPreview}" Value="True">
                                                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                        </DataTrigger>
                                                    </Style.Triggers>
                                                </Style>
                                            </TextBlock.Style>
                                        </TextBlock>
                                        <!-- Viewbox + 原图像素尺寸：区域内等比缩放，保持原图宽高比 -->
                                        <Viewbox
                                            Stretch="Uniform"
                                            StretchDirection="Both"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                                            Margin="6">
                                            <Viewbox.Style>
                                                <Style TargetType="Viewbox">
                                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                    <Style.Triggers>
                                                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasLatestAiAnnotationPreview}" Value="True">
                                                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                        </DataTrigger>
                                                    </Style.Triggers>
                                                </Style>
                                            </Viewbox.Style>
                                            <Image
                                                Source="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreview}"
                                                Width="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreviewPixelWidth}"
                                                Height="{Binding LatestAiAnnotationPreviewPixelHeight}"
                                                Stretch="Fill"
                                                SnapsToDevicePixels="True"
                                                RenderOptions.BitmapScalingMode="HighQuality" />
                                        </Viewbox>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>

                <!-- 检测统计（Demo 假数据） -->
                <Border Visibility="{Binding IsNavStats, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}" Style="{StaticResource CasWhiteCardStyle}">
                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                <TextBlock Text="检测统计" Style="{StaticResource CasSectionHeaderStyle}" Margin="0"/>
                                <Border Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpIconBorderStyle}">
                                    <Border.ToolTip>
                                        <ToolTip>
                                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpToolTipTextStyle}">
                                                <Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="当前状态" />
                                                <LineBreak />
                                                <Run Text="Demo 界面：展示当日总数 / OK / NG 与统计图。真实检测判定接入后改为读库。" />
                                            </TextBlock>
                                        </ToolTip>
                                    </Border.ToolTip>
                                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource CasParamHelpIconTextStyle}" />
                                </Border>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <Border Style="{StaticResource CasInfoCalloutStyle}" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                                <DockPanel LastChildFill="True">
                                    <Button
                                        DockPanel.Dock="Right"
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormActionButtonStyle}"
                                        Content="刷新假数据"
                                        Command="{Binding RefreshStatsDemoCommand}"
                                        ToolTip="重新随机生成 Demo 数据，便于预览界面效果" />
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsDemoDateText, StringFormat=统计日期：{0}}" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,4,0,0" Text="{Binding StatsDemoNote}" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </DockPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <UniformGrid Columns="3" Margin="0,0,0,16">
                                <Border Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="16" Background="#F3F6FB" CornerRadius="8" BorderBrush="#D9E2EF" BorderThickness="1">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}" FontSize="13" Text="当日检测总数" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,8,0,0" FontSize="32" FontWeight="Bold"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource CasPrimaryTextBrush}"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsTodayTotal}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                                <Border Margin="4,0" Padding="16" Background="#EAF7EF" CornerRadius="8" BorderBrush="#B7E0C2" BorderThickness="1">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Foreground="#2EA85A" FontSize="13" Text="OK" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,8,0,0" FontSize="32" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#2EA85A"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsTodayOk}" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,4,0,0" Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsOkRateText, StringFormat=占比 {0}}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                                <Border Margin="8,0,0,0" Padding="16" Background="#FDECEC" CornerRadius="8" BorderBrush="#F5C2C2" BorderThickness="1">
                                    <StackPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Foreground="#D32F2F" FontSize="13" Text="NG" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,8,0,0" FontSize="32" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#D32F2F"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsTodayNg}" />
                                        <TextBlock Margin="0,4,0,0" Foreground="{StaticResource CasMutedTextBrush}"
                                                   Text="{Binding StatsNgRateText, StringFormat=占比 {0}}" />
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </UniformGrid>

                            <Grid>
                                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*" MinWidth="280" />
                                    <ColumnDefinition Width="1.4*" MinWidth="320" />
                                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <Border Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="12"
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                    <oxy:PlotView Height="320"
                                                  Model="{Binding StatsOkNgPieModel}"
                                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                                </Border>
                                <Border Grid.Column="1" Margin="8,0,0,0" Padding="12"
                                        Style="{StaticResource CasFormSectionStyle}">
                                    <oxy:PlotView Height="320"
                                                  Model="{Binding StatsHourlyBarModel}"
                                                  IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>
                </Border>

                <Grid Visibility="{Binding IsNavStepTest, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}">

                <Border Visibility="{Binding IsNavStepTest, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVis}}" Style="{StaticResource CasWhiteCardStyle}">
                    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                        <StackPanel>
